{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"关系 2-范畴"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"关系2-范畴"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $\\mathcal C$ 是有拉回的范畴, 则可定义一个 $2$-范畴 $\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)$, 称为<strong>关系 $2$-范畴</strong> ($2$-category of correspondences), 其对象为 $\\mathcal C$ 的对象,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Corr}(\\mathcal C)}(X,Y) = \\{X \\leftarrow Z \\to Y\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}}